り竿が？まさか釣りか？","nextNodeIds":[740290102]},{"nodeId":740290102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":2660336026,"text":"水辺と釣り竿があれば、釣りに決まってるでしょ。外の世界から来たのにそんなことも知らないとは、「世も末」だね。","nextNodeIds":[740290103,740290105]},{"nodeId":740290103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1305257706,"text":"世も末とか、言い過ぎでしょ…","nextNodeIds":[740290104]},{"nodeId":740290104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1462602298,"text":"そうだぞ！それにオイラたち、釣りに関してはずぶの素人じゃないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[740290107]},{"nodeId":740290107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3276291330,"text":"いや、そうじゃなくて…メリュジーヌは釣り竿で釣りなんかしないと思ってたからさ。それに…えっと、なんか違和感があるな…","nextNodeIds":[740290108]},{"nodeId":740290108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":3579748130,"text":"違和感って？外の人から教わった通りにやってるよ？デラロッシュはいい人だ。魚釣りを教えてくれて、釣り竿までくれたし。","nextNodeIds":[740290109]},{"nodeId":740290109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":1113510490,"text":"彼女の釣り竿は結構凄いやつみたいだけど、彼女は「プロ」で、わたしはただの「アマチュア」だから、これで十分。","nextNodeIds":[740290110]},{"nodeId":740290110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":723647802,"text":"うーん…でも、ずっと待ってるのに、どうして釣れないんだろう？","nextNodeIds":[740290111]},{"nodeId":740290111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2048283962,"text":"#へへっ、それなら{NICKNAME}先生とパイモン先生が原因を分析してやるぜ！","nextNodeIds":[740290112]},{"nodeId":740290112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":1742500970,"text":"#{NICKNAME}先生とパイモン先生って、デラロッシュよりすごいの？彼女はきれいな釣り竿を持ってるプロなのに…","nextNodeIds":[740290113]},{"nodeId":740290113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":844679258,"text":"へへっ、じゃあいっちょ、オイラたちの実力を見せつけてやるぜ。","nextNodeIds":[740290114]},{"nodeId":740290114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":554329586,"text":"でも、ここに魚なんている？","nextNodeIds":[740290115]},{"nodeId":740290115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":635976898,"text":"あっ！言われてみれば確かに…違和感の正体はそれだ！魚なんてどこにもいないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[740290116]},{"nodeId":740290116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":2461541978,"text":"魚…水中にいるのは水産品だけじゃないってデラロッシュが言ってた。えっと、「アレ」は魚の仲間なのかな？","nextNodeIds":[740290117]},{"nodeId":740290117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":552972658,"text":"…「アレ」が魚じゃないから、わたしのやり方では釣れないのかも？","nextNodeIds":[740290118]},{"nodeId":740290118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":1275566322,"text":"#{NICKNAME}先生…それにパイモン先生！教えて。どうすれば「アレ」を釣れるの？","nextNodeIds":[740290119]},{"nodeId":740290119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3195254282,"text":"お、おう！イアーラってすごく礼儀正しいんだな…もちろんいいぜ！でもその「アレ」って一体…","nextNodeIds":[740290120]},{"nodeId":740290120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":2153407954,"text":"「アレ」は水中をすいすい泳ぐんだ。つるつるしてて、とても捕まえづらい。","nextNodeIds":[740290121,740290123]},{"nodeId":740290121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":956044026,"text":"そう聞くと魚っぽいね。","nextNodeIds":[740290122]},{"nodeId":740290122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1245869866,"text":"他の水生生物の可能性もあるよな？","nextNodeIds":[740290125]},{"nodeId":740290125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3859270522,"text":"うーん…とにかく、水中に棲む生き物だってことは確かだろ。水面からは姿が見えないから、深くに隠れてるのかもな。","nextNodeIds":[740290126]},{"nodeId":740290126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2222323674,"text":"こういうときは、やっぱり「撒き餌」だ！食べ物で水の底にいる「アレ」をおびき寄せようぜ！","nextNodeIds":[740290127]},{"nodeId":740290127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":2292749682,"text":"でも「アレ」は、もうお腹いっぱいのはず…他のエサに替えたら食いつくかな？","nextNodeIds":[740290128]},{"nodeId":740290128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4186894330,"text":"そうだ！水にエサを撒いて釣り竿を立てれば、あとは釣れるのを待つだけだ。「アレ」がなにかはまだわかんないけどな。","nextNodeIds":[740290129]},{"nodeId":740290129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":11916210,"text":"#華麗な竿さばき…わたしももう一回やってみよう。エサは{NICKNAME}先生とパイモン先生に任せる。わたしは釣り竿を見張りつつ準備するね。プロみたいなきれいな釣り竿じゃないけど…","nextNodeIds":[740290130]},{"nodeId":740290130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3967424610,"text":"おう。エサ撒きなんて簡単なことはオイラたちに任せろ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":740290123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2208901810,"text":"そう聞くとメリュジーヌっぽいね。","nextNodeIds":[740290124]},{"nodeId":740290124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2424886954,"text":"イアーラが他のメリュジーヌと魚釣りごっこをしてる…それは変だろ！","nextNodeIds":[740290125]},{"nodeId":740290105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":376627018,"text":"パイモンは釣りが何か、当然知ってるよね。","nextNodeIds":[740290106]},{"nodeId":740290106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2219572194,"text":"#おう！だってオイラ、{NICKNAME}に釣り竿で釣りあげられたんだぞ…って、ちっがーう！問題はそこじゃない！","nextNodeIds":[740290107]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7402901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7400605,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7400716,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_NOT_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_