りができるでしょ。","nextNodeIds":[740290314]},{"nodeId":740290314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":2964687122,"text":"中々の妙案だと思ったのに、いくら待っても「アレ」が針に食いつかなかった。","nextNodeIds":[740290315]},{"nodeId":740290315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3246610242,"text":"わざわざマンマルタコを捕まえて水に放し、釣り竿で釣る練習をするってのがそもそも気になるけど…","nextNodeIds":[740290316]},{"nodeId":740290316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1991414874,"text":"でもさっきオイラたちが撒いたエサに反応して、「アレ」が水面に浮かんできただろ？今までエサをいっぱい撒いてみようとは思わなかったのか？","nextNodeIds":[740290317]},{"nodeId":740290317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":474337258,"text":"ひき肉、パンくず、ワーム、ミント、パーツ…色んなエサを試してみた…でも「アレ」は食べたらすぐに沈んでいった。だからエサは役に立たないと思ったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[740290318]},{"nodeId":740290318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1180530322,"text":"えっ？パーツ！？それはどう考えてもエサじゃないだろ…","nextNodeIds":[740290319,740290321]},{"nodeId":740290319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":460446754,"text":"変なものを水産品に食べさせないで。","nextNodeIds":[740290320]},{"nodeId":740290320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2705465874,"text":"そうだそうだ！でもその水産品って言い方は…","nextNodeIds":[740290323]},{"nodeId":740290323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":3790971642,"text":"うーん。パーツは貴重品だし、マンマルタコが食べないなら、なんとかして取り出さないと。","nextNodeIds":[740290324]},{"nodeId":740290324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":2535257658,"text":"#そうだ、{NICKNAME}先生とパイモン先生の協力に感謝して、パーツをあげるよ。","nextNodeIds":[740290325]},{"nodeId":740290325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1214857618,"text":"…いや、いいよ。別にたいした協力もしてないし…","nextNodeIds":[740290326]},{"nodeId":740290326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":2646331602,"text":"え？お世話になる人のことは、「先生」と呼べってデラロッシュが言ってた。「有料で相談」したら、相手は喜ぶよって。そうじゃないの？","nextNodeIds":[740290327]},{"nodeId":740290327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":3144399514,"text":"この乾燥したパーツをあげる。メリュシー村では役に立つよ。","nextNodeIds":[740290328]},{"nodeId":740290328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":683938218,"text":"イアーラがそう言うなら…ありがたく受け取るぜ！","nextNodeIds":[740290329]},{"nodeId":740290329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5321,"speakerName":"イアーラ","textMapHash":1210154642,"text":"#うん。また{NICKNAME}先生とパイモン先生に華麗な釣り技を教えてもらいたいな。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":740290321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4211272850,"text":"マンマルタコってパーツを食べるんだね…","nextNodeIds":[740290322]},{"nodeId":740290322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4009389858,"text":"この状況だと、間違えて食べたと考えるのが正解だろうな…","nextNodeIds":[740290323]},{"nodeId":740290306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3597152082,"text":"「アレ」に攻撃されるのが怖くて…","nextNodeIds":[740290307]},{"nodeId":740290307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2013074522,"text":"危険を察知したら先制攻撃だぞ！うん…","nextNodeIds":[740290308]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7402903,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133403235"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7404401","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_INC_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7402901","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0